will these gather campaings on app.mailerlite.com?


Context
Yes. The API uses your MailerLite account, so:

Campaigns you create via the admin modal will appear in app.mailerlite.com under Campaigns

Campaigns you create in app.mailerlite.com will appear in your admin campaigns tab

Everything is the same account — the API is just another way to interact with it

The only thing you can't do via API is use MailerLite's drag-and-drop visual editor. Campaigns created via API will show up in MailerLite's dashboard and you can even open them there to edit the design before sending if you save them as drafts first.

Recommended workflow:

Create campaign as draft via your admin (sets name, subject, groups)

Open app.mailerlite.com → find the draft → use the visual editor to design it

Send from there — or come back to your admin and it'll show in the campaigns list

